                        <button type="button" class="absolute top-2 right-2 text-red-500 bg-white hover:bg-red-50 border border-red-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition shadow-sm btn-remove"><i class="fas fa-trash-alt mr-1"></i> Xóa</button>
